ohos-gpu-fence-capability.patch, ohos-gl-init-diagnostics.patch,
ohos-gpu-lose-context-debug-url.patch (also for gpu_service_impl.h) and
ohos-vulkan-compositor-diagnostics.patch, and for gpu_channel_manager.cc
after ohos-gpu-context-lost-recovery.patch and
ohos-gpu-context-failure-log-throttle.patch.

